ZEHRA SE KEHDO AUN-O-MOHAMMED KO LAYIYE<br>
<br>
Zehra se kehdo Aun-o-Mohammed ko layiye,<br>
Bachhon ko maa ke lashe ki surat dikhayiye<br>
<br>
Ya Fatima duhayi hai ab jald aaiye,<br>
Zainab shaheed hogayi lasha uthaiye,<br>
Abid hai qaid ap hi madfan banaiye,<br>
Marqad me apni beti ki maiyyat litaaiye<br>
<br>
Zehra se kehdo..<br>
Bachon ko..<br>
<br>
Mazlome karbala ki behen qatl hogayi,<br>
Seh seh ke lakho'n ranjo mehan qatl hogyi,<br>
Be jurm thi aseere rasan qatl hogayi,<br>
Durron se sara neela tha tan qatl hogayi<br>
<br>
Zehra se kehdo..<br>
Bacchon ko maa..<br>
<br>
Sajjad qaid me hai chudata nahi koi,<br>
Ummat se haye purse ko aata nahi koi,<br>
Binte Ali ki hazri laata nahi koi,<br>
Sab ek taraf hai qabr banata nahi koi<br>
<br>
Zehra se kehdo..<br>
Bacchon ko maa..